      "text": {
        "hi": "किताब: सोचो तुम एक परी हो। मैं पूछूँगा ‘Would you like to ...?’ जवाब दो: ‘Yes, I would.’ या ‘No, I won't.’",
        "hinglish": "Kitaab: socho tum ek pari ho. Main poochhunga ‘Would you like to ...?’ Jawab do: ‘Yes, I would.’ ya ‘No, I won't.’",
        "en": "The book: imagine you are a fairy. I'll ask ‘Would you like to ...?’ Answer ‘Yes, I would.’ or ‘No, I won't.’"
      }
